<title>SWEDEN: Trelleborg sells U.S. Intertrade unit.</title>
<headline>Trelleborg sells U.S. Intertrade unit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish metals and mining group Trelleborg said on Monday it had reached an agreement to sell Atlanta, Georgia-based Intertrade Inc. to a consortium of investors.</p>
